<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Wholesale, prod prices.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE NEXT WEEK - Wholesale, prod prices.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR     PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					   DATA		   DATE</p>
<p>Wholesale prices  Aug	-0.5 m/m, -0.5 y/y	 Sept 16</p>
<p>Producer prices   Aug	unch m/m, -0.8 y/y	 Sept 20-23</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
